    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im in the garden and just stabbed my foot pretty good with an old rusty trowel. its a deep puncture wound and bleeding a bit but i cleaned it with water. do i really need to go to the docs for this or can i just clean it well with soap and some peroxide and be fine?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
