    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the peroxide and ointment seems easy enough. but u said maybe i should get a tetanus shot if im unsure... honestly im pretty sure i had one a few years ago when i got a vaccine for school so i probably dont need it right? like the wound is mostly clean now so it shouldn't be a big deal unless it starts swelling or something. can i just watch it for a few days?",
